  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Lily has a big toy box. It is in her bedroom. \"Mia, look!\" says Lily. \"How many animals?\" asks Mia. Lily counts. \"One bear.\" \"Two bats.\" \"Three frogs.\"",
      "\"Four ducks.\" Mia claps. \"Ten animals!\" says Mia. Lily looks in the box again. She sees an alien. It is green. \"Is it a toy?\" asks Mia. \"Yes, it is,\" says Lily.",
      "Then Lily sees balloons. \"How many balloons?\" asks Lily. \"Five red balloons and one blue balloon.\" \"Six balloons!\" says Lily. Lily and Mia are happy. \"I like my toys,\" says Lily."
    ],
    "summary": "Lily and Mia count the toys in a toy box. They count ten animals, a green alien, and six balloons.",
